{"chapter-slug":"rw5-53","paragraph":13,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Those who followed Headscratcher, the [Berserker] with the enchanted axe and the ability to burst into tears while watching a play in Erin’s inn, were fighters to the core.","id":"0a3173b4-d11d-5215-ae84-dc4a1e0165c6"}
