{"chapter-slug":"rw5-53","paragraph":319,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The [Weapon Expert] grinned, raising his hands, but Headscratcher didn’t. The [Berserker]’s eyes flashed.","id":"3275c60e-a955-530d-8145-0cf7c78c4f17"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw5-53","paragraph":326,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"named","holder-quote":"He stared at Headscratcher as the [Berserker] stared at his bloody fists.","id":"c023c902-4b0c-5b01-bf7a-b4f694209211"}
