{"chapter-slug":"rw5-41","paragraph":145,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"named","holder-slug":"headscratcher","holder-quote":"They glanced at Headscratcher, who was massaging his scraped knuckles and staring blankly at the door and Numbtongue who was making music. Both had new classes.","id":"8076c5b6-47e9-5284-bdd6-f62d55f6222f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw5-41","paragraph":296,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"used","holder-slug":"headscratcher","holder-quote":"Headscratcher stood up and realized he had blood all over him. The moth’s, not his. Numbtongue frowned.","effect-quote":"Headscratcher roared and gave into the rage. When the rage’s veil of mist cleared from his eyes he was standing over the dead moth. Someone—him—had ripped its head clean off.","id":"46aeece0-b922-55a8-8b6b-a0ab2ea9de58"}
